  "content": "\n\n# Lux V1\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patreon.com/techthedev\"><img src=\"https://intellitonic.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/become_a_patron_button@2x.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" width=\"300\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://discord.gg/eZ6GpXQXGC\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/853294489636831242?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=ffffff&color=5865f2&link=https%3A%2F%2Fdiscord.gg%2FuBhFaBG\" style=\"height: 50px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://twitter.com/TheRealTechDev\"><img alt=\"关注 X (原 Twitter)\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/TheRealTechDev?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=black&labelColor=white&color=%23101013\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/lux-shaders\"><img alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/863609?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=%23f16436&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/lux-v1\"><img alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/DiGQENDV?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=%2316a869&labelColor=ffffff\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n![Imgur](https://imgur.com/p2kIQGi.jpg)\n\nLux 是一款高保真《我的世界》Java 版着色器包，基于 [Capt Tatsu 的 BSL 着色器](https://bitslablab.com \"Takes you to the BSL Website\")。\n\n默认情况下，Lux 面向中高端用户，但提供了广泛的设置选项，让着色器真正符合你的个性化需求。在力求兼容不同软硬件配置、兼顾美观与游戏性的同时，Lux 还融入了实验性及罕见的特性。该着色器包更新频繁，虽仍属新作，但已采用更现代的技术打造出色的视觉效果，绝对不容错过。\n\n## 问题反馈\n\n如遇任何问题，请使用 [GitHub 问题追踪器](https://github.com/TechDevOnGitHub/Lux-Shader/issues) 进行反馈。",
